---
import ParadoxLayout from '../layouts/ParadoxLayout.astro';
---

<ParadoxLayout slug="inspection-paradox">
    <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">The Inspection Paradox, or waiting-time paradox, says that when you arrive at a random
    time, you’re more likely to encounter a long interval than a short one. This happens because longer gaps are more likely
    to contain the moment you arrive. The usual mistake is assuming that if buses arrive every 10 minutes on average, then a randomly arriving passenger should wait about 5 minutes. That only works when the intervals are regular.
    <br>Adjust the "Chaos" slider to make buses bunch up. Click "Spawn Passenger" to see why you always land in the longest waits.</p>

    <div class="bg-slate-50 p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 mb-6 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 items-center">
        <div>
            <label class="flex justify-between text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-2">
                Schedule Chaos (How Uneven the Gaps Are): <span id="ip-chaos-val" class="text-purple-600 font-mono">6</span>
            </label>
            <input type="range" id="ip-chaos-slider" min="0" max="8" step="1" value="6" class="w-full accent-purple-600">
        </div>
        <div class="text-right">
            <button id="btn-passenger" class="w-full md:w-auto px-6 py-3 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white rounded-lg font-semibold transition-colors shadow-sm">
                Spawn Random Passenger
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div id="plot6" class="w-full h-64"></div>
    <div id="ip-result" class="mt-4 text-center p-4 bg-purple-50 text-purple-900 rounded-lg text-lg font-semibold"></div>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-6" id="brn-footnote">
			Further reading: Professor Leighton Vaughan Williams' article <a href="https://leightonvw.com/2024/12/11/the-inspection-paradox/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-purple-600 underline hover:text-purple-800">The Inspection Paradox</a>
       	,and
       	<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Renewal_theory" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-purple-600 underline hover:text-purple-800">Renewal theory on Wikipedia</a>.
		</p>
</ParadoxLayout>

<script>
    import '../scripts/paradoxes/inspection-paradox.js';
</script>
